      "text": "MARKET SEGMENTS (Techtex classification):\n  ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │  Agrotech    │ Crop covers, shade nets, silage wrap           │\n  │  Buildtech   │ Architectural membranes, geotextiles           │\n  │  Clothtech   │ Protective clothing (Kevlar, Nomex, FR)        │\n  │  Geotech     │ Civil engineering (reinforcement, filtration)  │\n  │  Hometech    │ Technical bedding, functional floor coverings  │\n  │  Indutech    │ Filtration, conveyor belts, industrial sealing │\n  │  Medtech     │ Sutures, mesh implants, wound dressings        │\n  │  Mobiltech   │ Airbags, seatbelts, tire cord, composites      │\n  │  Packtech    │ Industrial packaging                           │\n  │  Protech     │ Ballistic, fire, chemical protection           │\n  │  Sportech    │ Performance apparel, technical outerwear       │\n  └───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
